---
title: Payment Methods Configuration
sidebar:
  order: 3
---
Payment method settings in Taskip let you control which **payment gateways** your clients can use when paying invoices and quotations.\
\
Proper setup helps ensure **faster payments** and a smooth checkout experience.

### **Navigation Path**

**Settings → Financial → Payment Method**

![](./payment-methods-configuration/content/image-56-1024x772.png)

### **Payment Method Configuration**

1. **Choose a payment gateway from the available options:**
   - **Manual Payment**
   - [**PayPal**](https://taskip.net/integration/paypal/)
   - [**FastSpring**](https://taskip.net/integration/fastspring/)
   - [**Stripe**](https://taskip.net/integration/stripe/)
   - [**Razorpay**](https://taskip.net/integration/razorpay/)
   - [**Xendit**](https://taskip.net/integration/xendit/)
   - [\**Mollie\**](https://taskip.net/integration/moolie/)
   - [**Square**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-square-payment-gateway/)
   - [**GoCardless**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-gocardless-payment-gateway/)
   - [**Paystack**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-paystack-payment-gateway/)
   - [**Flutterwave**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-flutterwave-payment-gateway/)
   - [**Mercado Pago**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-mercado-pago-payment-gateway/)
   - [**SSLCommerz**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-sslcommerz-payment-gateway/)
   - [**bKash**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-bkash-payment-gateway/)
   - [**Authorize.net**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-authorize-net-payment-gateway/)
   - [**Paytm**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-paytm-payment-gateway/)
   - [**Easypaisa**](https://docs.taskip.net/payment-gateway/how-to-configure-easypaisa-payment-gateway/)
1. **Click on your preferred payment gateway.**

![](./payment-methods-configuration/content/image-54-1024x449.png)

{% table %}
---
- **Tip:** You can enable multiple payment gateways to give clients flexible payment options.
{% /table %}

3. **Enter the required account information.**

![](./payment-methods-configuration/content/image-55-1024x425.png)

4. **Click Save Changes to make the payment gateway available to clients.**

![](./payment-methods-configuration/content/image-57.png)

{% table %}
---
- **Note:** Only activated payment methods will appear on invoices and checkout pages.
{% /table %}
